      "text": "On Day 5: from about 14:15 to 17:15 I was at the workshop; around 17:15 I passed through the square; around 17:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 17:30 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:19 I passed through Mill Road; around 19:25 I passed through the square; from about 19:30 to 22:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 22:15 I passed through the square; around 22:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:30 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
