      "text": "On Day 5: from about 14:15 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:08 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:14 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 23:00 I was at the Crooked Pike; around 23:01 I passed through the square; around 23:03 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:00 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
